# EDGE PANEL — local development secrets
# Copy this file to `.dev.vars` (NEVER commit `.dev.vars` — it is git-ignored).
# On Cloudflare, set the same two secrets with:
#   wrangler secret put ADMIN_PASSWORD
#   wrangler secret put SESSION_SECRET
#
# ADMIN_PASSWORD — password of the owner account (username: AMINCK).
#                  Minimum length: 10 characters.
ADMIN_PASSWORD=
# SESSION_SECRET — random key used to HMAC-SHA256 sign admin session cookies.
#                  Generate with:  openssl rand -hex 32
SESSION_SECRET=